      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLASHBACK JIM (8) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 350m at Goulburn, taking a Grade 5 in a quick 19.90. Hard to top on the time from two back. MS. TROPEA (4) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only 1.5 lengths from Chewing The Fat in third (19.22) at this track. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Can measure up. RUN BINDI RUN (1) has been in the money at her last two runs, most recently when second beaten 4 lengths (19.23). Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from six starts. Hard to beat again. CLASSIC EDGE (3) is always a threat when she races at this journey.",
